@participant3, is this still working for you? On the latest Helix version (23.03), it doesn't work. This is the configuration:

`languages.toml`
```toml
[[language]]
name = "python"
auto-format = true
language-server = { command = "pyright-langserver", args = ["--stdio"] }
config = {}
```

`pyrightconfig.json`
```json
{
 "typeCheckingMode": "off"
}
```

I still get type errors in Helix, but running `pyright file.py` doesn't show them.
